use: engine

to begin:
  scrawl "coin ", object name of me, " at ", place of me
and the universe said i love you

to every frame, given seconds (a number):
  turn the object with me, 90 times seconds
  move the object with me, 0 horizontal (seconds) vertical 0 depth
and the universe said i love you

to touched, given other (a number):
  if object name of other is "Player":
    copy the object with me, place of me plus 0 horizontal 2 vertical 0 depth
    remove the object me
    colour the object with the object named "Player", "red"
and the universe said i love you
